  <prompt>Write an integration test that composes HeaderToolbar + RecordHeaderShell + FieldGrid + all four field renderers + all three hooks against a mocked Xrm.WebApi, mirroring the MatterHeaderView.tsx shape from spec FR-12. Verifies Phase 1 primitives work together end-to-end.</prompt>

