  <steps>
    <step order="1">Mock global.Xrm: WebApi.retrieveRecord returns {sprk_matternumber:"M-1", sprk_name:"Test", sprk_mattertype:{...}, sprk_practicearea:{...}, sprk_description:"..."} for the sprk_matter entity.</step>
    <step order="2">Mock retrieveMultipleRecords for sprk_memo (@odata.count=3), sprk_todo (@odata.count=7), sprk_recordsummary (value=[{sprk_body:"Summary"}]).</step>
    <step order="3">Render a TestRecordHeader FC that composes: useRecordHeaderToolbarActions({entity, recordId}) + useRecordFieldValues + RecordHeaderShell + FieldGrid + 5 field children matching FR-12.</step>
    <step order="4">Assert: three toolbar slots rendered; badges show 3 and 7; five fields visible with correct span layout.</step>
    <step order="5">Simulate window focus event; verify badges refetch.</step>
    <step order="6">Simulate sparkle click; verify Popover opens with summary body; refresh icon click is a no-op.</step>
    <step order="7">Run tests.</step>
    <step order="8">Update TASK-INDEX.md: mark 014 ✅.</step>
